rial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e개선 사항 \u0026amp; 기타\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.1 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e국내\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전\u0026nbsp;출시\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9월\u0026nbsp;7일\u0026nbsp;점검\u0026nbsp;완료\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;국내\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;버전을\u0026nbsp;한국\u0026nbsp;공식\u0026nbsp;홈페이지에서\u0026nbsp;다운로드하실\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.2 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e특정 상황에서 A2 기본 의상과 A2: 요르하 제복 프로토타입의 모션이 순간적으로 어색해 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.3 2B의 SD 모델 기본 모션 중 특정 부위가 어색해 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.4 주크박스에서 OuteR:Automata 유실물로 